From cfcc9b1d7be2cba8c5f5b21d28607d7e91f06b4d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Brad Barnett <127794626+bdbarnett@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 28 Jul 2026 00:18:18 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] windows: enable networking (sockets, select, ssl, msvc).

Add a windows-local modsocket.c (derived from the unix port) with Winsock
support, select/asyncio wakeups, mingw/msvc mbedtls SSL, MSVC project glue,
and related test updates.

Based-on: micropython e0e9fbb17 (tag v1.28.0)
